  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/319/ex_machinis_sf.png\" alt=\"Ex Machinis\" width=\"1416\" height=\"788\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>这是<a href=\"\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ex Deorum</a>的自动化扩展模组。添加了RF驱动的筛子、锤子和压缩机。这是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-machinis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ex Machinis</a>的移植版本。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>该模组不提供能源生成功能——你需要使用其他模组来实现，例如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Expansion</a>或<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/powah-rearchitected\" rel=\"nofollow\">Powah! Rearchitected</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>图片中使用的模组：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblefordays\" rel=\"nofollow\">CobbleForDays</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pipez</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Expansion</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>模组展示：</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cPikjwQnKpE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>",
